evel 13, Guoco Tower, Damansara City,\nNo, 6, Jalan Damanlela,\nBukit Damansara,\n50490 Kuala Lumpur\n\nMon - Sun\n(Including Public Holiday)\n10am - 6pm\n\nTelephone\n+6016 3366 923--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAnnual Report 2024 21 (https://guocoland.com.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Guocoland-AR24-Final-for-Bursa.pdf)\nciteturn365search13 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.9 years ago; Menara Guoco is certified Green Building by Green Building Index (GBI) and awarded Gold by the Leadership in Energy and Environmental Design (LEED), while DC Residensi comprises 370 luxury serviced apartments with optimal unit layouts and exceptional amenities.\nAnnual Report 2024 21\n\nMANAGEMENT DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS cont’d\n\nSEGMENTAL REVIEW OF OPERATIONS cont’d\n\nProperty Development cont’d\n\n**Damansara City**\n\nDamansara City in the affluent neighbourhood of Damansara Heights, Kuala Lumpur, serves as the area’s first transit-oriented integrated mixed development. Built on an 8.5-acre freehold land, it encompasses two Grade A office buildings, namely Menara Hong Leong and Menara Guoco; two residential blocks, DC Residensi, the 5-star Sofitel Kuala Lumpur Damansara hotel; and the 5-storey DC Mall.\n\nMenara Guoco is certified Green Building by Green Building Index (GBI) and awarded Gold by the Leadership in Energy and Environmental Design (LEED), while DC Residensi comprises 370 luxury serviced apartments with optimal unit layouts and exceptional amenities.\n\n**Property Investment**\n\nMeanwhile, our property investment segment saw meaningful growth, particularly with the increase in our stake in Tower REIT from 21.66% to 33.32%. This strategic move has enhanced our recurring income stream and strengthened our position in the property investment market.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nResidential Properties: Current Launches - Singapore (https://www.guocoland.com.sg/Properties/MY/DC.shtml)\nciteturn365search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 days ago; Featuring two upscale private residential towers, DC Residensi is an important component of Damansara City, GuocoLand Malaysia's flagship project and the first integrated development project in the exclusive Damansara Heights enclave. ... This award winning residence comprises 370 units of contemporary designed and luxurious homes, with sizes ranging from 1-bedroom to 3+1 bedroom units and penthouses.\n  Malaysia - Current Launches\n \n \nImage Image Image ❮ ❯\n \n  DC Residensi, Damansara City\nFeaturing two upscale private residential towers, DC Residensi is an important component of Damansara City, GuocoLand Malaysia's flagship project and the first integrated development project in the exclusive Damansara Heights enclave. Residents will enjoy seamless integration with the luxury of a five-star hotel, the convenience of a lifestyle mall and the efficient proximity of premium office towers, all within the 8.5-acre freehold development of Damansara City. This award winning residence comprises 370 units of contemporary designed and luxurious homes, with sizes ranging from 1-bedroom to 3+1 bedroom units and penthouses. The typical units have gross builtup areas ranging from 899 sq ft to 2,705 sq ft. Residents can also look forward to impeccable quality of living at DC Residensi with top-notch fittings from luxurious brands such as Miele, Gessi Emporio, Poggenpohl and Catalano. One can also enjoy generous facilities against the KL and PJ skyline; these include an Olympic-length salt water infinity pool, mini theatre, aqua massage area and more--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad Annual Report 2023 (https://guocoland.com.my/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/GuocoLand-Malaysia-Berhad_Annual-Report-2023_FINAL-REPORT-2.pdf)\nciteturn365search14 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3.0 years ago; GuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad Annual Report 2023 ... DC Residensi is made up of 370 luxury serviced apartments that offers choice unit layouts and exceptional amenities.\nGuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad Annual Report 2023\n\n# MANAGEMENT’S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS\ncont’d\n\n## REVIEW OF OPERATIONS cont’d\n\n### PROPERTY DEVELOPMENT cont’d\n\n#### Damansara City\n\nDamansara City is the first integrated project in Damansara Heights, one that is designed to embrace the hallmarks of a Transit-Oriented Development. Built on a 8.5-acre freehold land, the development includes two Grade A office blocks, Menara Hong Leong and Menara Guoco; two residential blocks, DC Residensi; an internationally renowned hotel, Sofitel Kuala Lumpur Damansara; and a vibrant 5-storey lifestyle mall, DC Mall.\n\nBoth the Grade A office towers are certified Green Buildings by the Green Building Index and awarded Gold by the Leadership in Energy and Environmental Design (LEED). DC Residensi is made up of 370 luxury serviced apartments that offers choice unit layouts and exceptional amenities.\n\n### PROPERTY INVESTMENT\n\n#### DC Mall\n\nAs an integral part Damansara City, DC Mall is a five-storey lifestyle mall that offers a vibrant mix of dining, shopping, banking, and health facilities within its approximately 170,000 square feet of net lettable space.\n\nIn our effort to cater to the growing working population in its vicinity, DC Mall continues to offer a variety of F&B options including Hometown Hainan Coffee, myCU, Nyonya Colors, Birch and Hijau, along with the newly introduced F&B destination, DC Mall Food Village. Since its launch, the Food Village has continued to operate at near full capacity during weekday lunch hours.\n\nThese culinary haven features a diverse selection of renowned hawker food and Asian delicacies, carefully curated to tantalise the tastebuds.\n\n<visual_element id=\"e1\">\nNight aerial photograph of Damansara City mixed-use development with illuminated towers and roads; visible labels include “HONG LEONG”, “SOFITEL”