------------------------------------\nDC Residensi - KL Damansara Heights New Condominium For Sale or Rent (https://www.klccproperties.net/dc-residensi/)\nciteturn365search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4.5 years ago; Crawled: last week; ( Completed Property ) DC Residensi is a serviced residence within an award winning integrated development consisting of luxury residences, corporate office towers, hotel and a retail mall. ... The built-ups of the residences ranges from 904 to 2,982 square feet. ...   * Developer: GuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad\n\n# DC Residensi\n\nSale, Serviced Apartment\n\nImage: Outer KLCC luxurt condominium\n\n( Completed Property ) DC Residensi is a serviced residence within an award winning integrated development consisting of luxury residences, corporate office towers, hotel and a retail mall.\n\n It is located at Damansara Heights, Kuala Lumpur.\n\nDC Residensi offer residences in one- bedroom to five-bedroom layouts. The built-ups of the residences ranges from 904 to 2,982 square feet.\n\n## DC Residensi\n\n  * Property type: Condominium (with Sofitel Hotel, Office Towers, Retail Mall)\n  * Location: Jalan Damanlela, Damansara Heights, Kuala Lumpur\n  * Tenure: Freehold\n  * Number of towers: 2 towers | 28-storey | 4 lifts serving 9 units per floor\n  * Number of units: 370 units\n  * Built-up size | Rooms : 904 sq. ft. to 2,982 sq. ft. | 1 room to 5+1 rooms\n  * Developer: GuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad\n\n### Types of Unit\n\n  * 1 room (904 sq. ft.)\n  * 1 +1 room (1,152  – 1,194 sq. ft.)\n  * 2+1 rooms (1,668 sq. ft.)\n  * 2+1+1 rooms (1,851-1,863 sq. ft.)\n  * 3+1 rooms (2,077 sq. ft.)\n  * 3+1+1 rooms (2,702 sq. ft.)--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDC Residensi, Damansara Heights Ulasan | PropertyGuru Malaysia (https://www.propertyguru.com.my/bm/perumahan-baru/review/dc-residensi-damansara-heights-215044)\nciteturn365search6 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5.5 years ago; Crawled: last week; DC Residensi is part of the 8.5-acre freehold Damansara City transit-oriented (TOD) development by GuocoLand Malaysia. ... So, if you’re interested in a 904 sq ft unit at DC Residensi that’s priced at RM1.45 million, here are its estimated loan figures.\n\n# DC Residensi, Damansara Heights\n\n  * Pavither\n  * ⋅\n  * 5 April 2021\n\nDC Residensi is part of the 8.5-acre freehold Damansara City transit-oriented (TOD) development by GuocoLand Malaysia. It is located in Damansara Heights, one of the affluent communities in Kuala Lumpur.\n\nThe other components in Damansara City are DC Corporate Towers (2 Grade-A office towers), the 200,000 sq ft DC Mall, and the 5-star Sofitel KL Damansara. One of the office towers, a 33-storey Grade-A office tower block has a useable area of 530,000 sq ft and it is occupied by the Hong Leong Group.\n\nThe RM2.5 billion integrated development of Damansara City is located on 8.5 acres of freehold land. It has been in operational since 2016, and it is becoming the new pulse of Damansara Heights.\n\nDC Residensi Tower A achieved a take-up rate of 60% during its pre-launch for foreign investors in May 2015. The project was officially launched in July 2015. The selling price for Tower A is RM1,350 per sq ft.\n\nAddress: Jalan Damanlela, 50490 Kuala Lumpur\n\nDeveloper: GuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad\n\nProperty Type: Condominium\n\nLand Area: 8.5 acres\n\nLand Title: Commercial\n\nNo. of Blocks: 2\n\nNo. of Storeys: 28\n\nTotal Units: 370\n\nTenure: Freehold\n\nYear of Completion: 2017\n\nBuilt-up Area: 904 sq ft – 2,982 sq ft\n\nFacilities:\n\nLevel 6\n\n  * Reflective pool\n  * Timber deck\n  * Barbeque area\n  * Multi-purpose hall\n  * Private dining rooms\n  * Wading pool\n  * Sunken deck\n  * Landscaped areas\n  * 50m salt-water infinity pool\n  * Aqua gymnasium\n  * Jacuzzi\n  * Sauna & steam rooms\n  * Outdoor cabanas\n\nLevel 6A\n\n  * Games room\n  * Function room\n  * Mini theatre\n  * Glass-walled gymnasium\n  * Play area\n  * Childcare area\n\nLaunch Price: From RM1,753,000\n\nLaunch Price Per Sq Ft: From RM1,350 psf\n\nMaintenance Fee: RM0.35 per sq ft\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDC Residensi, Damansara Heights (Completed 2017) – Apartment Kuala Lumpur (https://www.apartmentkualalumpur.com/dc-residensi-damansara-heights/)\nciteturn365search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; DC Residensi is part of the award winning integrated development consisting of luxury residences, corporate office towers, hotel and a retail mall. ... The built-up space of each unit ranges from 904 sq. ft. to 2,982 sq. ft. ...   * Developer: GuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad\n\nDamansara Heights\n\n# DC Residensi, Damansara Heights (Completed 2017)\n\nDC Residensi is part of the award winning integrated development consisting of luxury residences, corporate office towers, hotel and a retail mall. It is located at Damansara Heights, Kuala Lumpur. The luxury residences offer condominium units with one- bedroom to five-bedroom layouts. The built-up space of each unit ranges from 904 sq. ft. to 2,982 sq. ft.\n\nDC Residensi has many amenities nearby, e.g. schools, metro transport stations and universities. The following are some schools here:\n\n  * Cempaka International School Damansara Heights\n  * Eaton School House\n  * Maz International Pre School\n  * Stella Maris School Medan Damansara (Primary)\n\nAs for metro transport stations, there are MRT Pusat Bandar Damansara and MRT Semantan. There are also some universities here, such as Cyberlynx International College and Help Matriculation Centre (HMC) Help University.\n\n## DC Residensi\n\n  * Property type: Condominium (with Sofitel Hotel, Office Towers, Retail Mall)\n  * Location: Jalan Damanlela, Damansara Heights, Kuala Lumpur\n  * Tenure: Freehold\n  * Number of towers: 2 towers | 28-storey | 4 lifts serving 9 units per floor\n  * Number of units: 370 units\n  * Built-up size: 904 sq. ft. to 2,982 sq. ft. | 1 room to 