, which offers 312 well-appointed rooms and over 15,000 sq ft of meeting and event facilities.\n### MALAYSIA BUSINESS UPDATES (CONTINUED)\n\nTOTAL GROSS FLOOR AREA:\n\n1.8 million sq ft\n\nCOMMITTED OCCUPANCY OF MENARA GUOCO AS AT 30 JUNE 2025:\n\n97%\n\nDamansara City is developed by GuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad (\"GLM\"), an indirect subsidiary of GuocoLand that is listed on the Main Market of Bursa Malaysia Securities Berhad. The award-winning Damansara City is the first integrated mixed development in Kuala Lumpur's prime Damansara Heights district. Located within Damansara City are two Grade A office towers including Menara Guoco; DC Residensi, which comprises 370 luxury residences across two towers; DC Mall, with approximately 170,000 sq ft of retail space spread over five levels; and the luxurious Sofitel Kuala Lumpur Damansara, which offers 312 well-appointed rooms and over 15,000 sq ft of meeting and event facilities.\n\nTOTAL NO. OF UNITS: EXCLUDES ONE TOWER DEDICATED TO RUMAH SELANGORKU, A HOUSING SCHEME IN SELANGOR\n\n1,888\n\n% OF UNITS SOLD AS AT 30 JUNE 2025:\n\nEmerald 9 is a bold, transit-oriented integrated mixed development being developed by GLM. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGuocoLand Malaysia (https://guocoland.com.my/about-us/)\nciteturn365search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Among GuocoLand Malaysia’s notable prime projects are Damansara City (“DC”) – the award-winning first integrated luxury development located in the prime neighbourhood of Damansara Heights, Emerald Rawang – a master-planned township which comprises different types of residences in Rawang, Emerald Sepang – a residential township in Sepang, and The Oval Kuala Lumpur – a unique luxury condominium in the heart of Kuala Lumpur City Centre, as well as commercial developments, namely PJ City corporate hub in Petaling Jaya.\n\n## About Us\n\nImage\n\n# Corporate Profile\n\nGuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad (“GLM”) is the property arm of Hong Leong Group. The company is an established property developer in developing community-centric residential townships as well as innovative commercial and integrated development projects in Malaysia. GuocoLand Malaysia is a subsidiary of the Singapore-based GuocoLand Limited, the multi-award-winning premier regional property player with established operations in Singapore, China, and Malaysia.\nGuocoLand Malaysia has a sizeable land bank for residential, commercial and industrial developments in the Greater Kuala Lumpur and Melaka. Among GuocoLand Malaysia’s notable prime projects are Damansara City (“DC”) – the award-winning first integrated luxury development located in the prime neighbourhood of Damansara Heights, Emerald Rawang – a master-planned township which comprises different types of residences in Rawang, Emerald Sepang – a residential township in Sepang, and The Oval Kuala Lumpur – a unique luxury condominium in the heart of Kuala Lumpur City Centre, as well as commercial developments, namely PJ City corporate hub in Petaling Jaya.\n"
